<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Bugged...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Does all that baffling stuff <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> did have something to do with the bugging...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I can't talk about this in front of <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>. I'll wait for a chance at Zahha to have her explain, then...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "2000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Zahha was busy with groups that looked like high school students.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! The drink bar's all yours!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, okay. </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">... cola like always?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's all yours! Oh, but don't forget the ice and the straw! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">Actually, maybe hot coffee would be better?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Got it! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, what about you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Um, I'll have..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I glanced over at <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> grinned back at me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'll have the same as </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okay! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Wait... </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, don't you hate coffee?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? Oh, uh, then―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, they started carrying matcha lattes this month! The hot one is Goto's personal pick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Th-then I'll have that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Okaaay! Wait for me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> left the table.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Getting something hot from the drink bar would take a little while.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did that mean she'd explain in the meantime?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Explain this!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"First, we keep this case from </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> until the very last moment. You understand why, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Natsumi's dad</STYLE> might be dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We should keep anything that would shock <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE> away from her.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Listen. The culprit needs to keep track of what we're doing at all times. Otherwise, they can't kill within today―April 8. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So I paid attention to the things that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, who found the paper dolls, had on her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The culprit probably assumes that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> will stick together."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. So that's why she suspected a bug.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But how'd you know it was the phone?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, our phones are a </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="そろ">matching</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> set, but do you know how much they weigh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? How would I know something like that..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"150 grams. Earlier, I took </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s jacket off her and slipped out her phone. Then I weighed all three phones on a </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="はかり">scale</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The result: only </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s phone came to 160 grams, even though it's the same model and has no strap. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">A full 10 grams heavier can't be a margin of error. That's how I knew a bug had been planted only in </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s phone."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why'd you zero in on the phone? There wasn't any suspicious gadget on it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, not just the phone. I paid attention to everything </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> had on her. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Earlier I got your clothes and shoes dirty, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. That was how I got you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, to take off the things you had on."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see... but if you put in an app or something, you could listen in without a device, right? Why go to the trouble of a bug..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"With something invisible like an app, it's true you can't find it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So first, I checked the possibility that a listening device had been planted. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">For better or worse, at that stage I found out something was inside, so I figured this had to be it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In a phone, a bug gets a constant supply of power, and it can send audio anywhere over the internet."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\春花かばう.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Even on a mountain, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\人質カラー.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">even on a rooftop. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">My phone holds a charge for about 2 days, but what about yours, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"2 days? Mine barely makes it through one... By the time I go to bed, my phone's always almost out of charge. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Does that mean the bug was eating up the power? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="3">Maybe there are security cameras planted in my place too?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, that's not very likely. A camera can only watch inside the house. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Rather than secretly having you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, carry a camera around, a bug is simpler. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If this is the work of the culprit behind the Megasawa City case, they must have prepared very carefully. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So the culprit must know full well which is more effective."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Plus, with the GPS function, they can pin down exactly where </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There should be an app called 'Friend GPS' that came preinstalled. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">GPS and a bug. With this much </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="そろ">in place</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, it's plenty to judge </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s situation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if that's all the culprit has to go on, then by turning it against them, we could even lure them into a </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="わな">trap</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">In other words, letting go of </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s phone is the safest defense against the shinigami."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, wait... Even if the bug's built only into my phone, with GPS, wouldn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s phones be in danger too? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　And if they're using some special GPS app..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's not very likely either. Installing a bugging app is way easier than building in a bug. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The fact that they went to the trouble of modifying the hardware means they wanted to modify the phone without us finding out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If there's a rogue app on it, a scanner app might find it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">With hardware, you can't tell unless you take it apart."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, I don't know what the culprit made of the 10-gram difference, but people hardly ever put a phone on a </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="はかり">scale</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and you can't tell 10 grams just by holding it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So the culprit would make full use of the functions that were already there. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The GPS was there to begin with, but a listening function wasn't, so that part alone needed modifying. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Just in case, I turned off the GPS on my phone and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s earlier, so no need to worry."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"In the first place, since the bug is built into </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s phone </STYLE><STYLE ID="8" RUBY="・・・">only</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I think it's unlikely that my phone and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s have been modified."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's getting kinda complicated and I'm losing track, but basically, it's fine to say there was a bug planted in my phone, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, that's plenty."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then who planted it, and when? I carry my phone around with me all the time..."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "1000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"There's someone, isn't there... Just one person, close to us. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The three of us were given our phones as presents by </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, as a </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="そろ">matching</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> set, weren't we?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai's father</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is an engineer at a company that makes cell phones. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Which means it's safe to assume he has the knowledge and skill to put a bug in a phone."</STYLE><PG>
In other words, <STYLE ID="4">Natsumi's dad</STYLE> planted a bug before he gave them to us?<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... isn't that a pretty big leap? Sure, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> could probably do it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But that's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s coming back."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry for the wait! Hot drinks really do take a while."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
Steaming cups were set down in front of us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"There sure are a lot of high schoolers here today. Can't be helped, with school closed... That case... I really hate it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>'s spirits were low. I wanted to bring up something as cheerful as I could.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"H-hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, how's second year going?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh? No, nothing much... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So far there's only been the opening ceremony and the entrance ceremony, so it hasn't really sunk in yet..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"W-well, yeah, I guess not... Um..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Haah... Actually, I was a little scared going to the convenience store alone earlier."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then why..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Because you wanted to talk with </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, just the two of you, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
I'm so bad at coming up with things to talk about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> was staring at <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>'s face.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hup!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\みょいん.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\みょいん.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島貼り付き.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly, <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE> grabbed a handful of my chest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "ごろごろゲームする日_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oho..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\みょいん.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Wh-wh-wh-what...!!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Ahn... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\みょいん.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">Hey... no, stop...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\みょいん.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">　</STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="も">Don't squeeze</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> them...!</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\みょいん.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Nooo...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... you've got quite something there. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This is way beyond what I pictured... can't even fit them in my hand."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
I reflexively shook off <STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE>'s squeezing hands.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"What're you doing all of a sudden!? You </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">groping old perv</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
